+ {
+ 	int i, err;
+ 
++	/* The EN7523 NPU WiFi RX firmware (vendor and OpenNPU) submits frames
++	 * to the PPE through QDMA0 TX ring 6 and reaps them from TX IRQ queue
++	 * 1. Linux still sets both up (1024 entries each, as the firmware
